# 4. Essential Questions

Students should encounter these questions throughout the week.

## Ratios

- What two quantities does this ratio compare?
- Is this a part-to-part comparison or a part-to-whole comparison?
- What is an equivalent way to write this ratio?

## Rates

- What are the two different units being compared?
- What is the amount for one unit?
- Which option is the better value?

## Proportions

- Are these two ratios or rates equal?
- What value makes these two ratios equal?
- Did I set up the proportion with matching units in matching positions?

## Reasoning

- Is my answer close to what I would expect?
- Does the unit of my final answer make sense?
- Could I check this a different way?

